{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The first probe reproduces the key mechanics cleanly: actions 1–4 translate the black 90-cell piece, action 5 rotates it, and action 6 is inert in the initial context. The level contains three fixed colored silhouettes and twelve 3×3 pegs; a generic 10k-state visible-frame BFS does not find reward, so history/context matters beyond the current avatar pose."}}
