{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The reproduced dense-score probe shows the top-row count is only clipping as the avatar leaves the screen, so I’m discarding it. More useful is the silhouette probe: level 2’s controlled piece has 10 logical cells, and the first fixed figure plus its nearby pivots appears to define a grappling/rotation route—not a simple overlay target. I’m narrowing the model by measuring pose transitions at each reachable peg and the exact reward-triggering contact from level 1."}}
