{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"Coordinate action 6 is the missing mechanic. Clicking a peg belonging to the 90-cell figure changes exactly 180 pixels (the current 90-cell avatar plus that figure); clicking the 162-cell or 45-cell figures changes 252 or 135 pixels respectively. This strongly indicates selection transfers control between figures, which explains why a single avatar cannot reach all relevant structures. I’m now verifying the recoloring and movement of each selected figure, then I’ll plan cooperative subgoals per figure."}}
